CPU Architecture and Performance Analysis

The basic kernels in src/kernels.c were adapted from an existing C benchmark
skeleton. The source files received with that skeleton contain no author,
copyright, or license notice. The MIT license in this repository applies to
the original project contributions. The inherited material has no separate
license recorded here.

The reference CSV files contain measurements from this project. The figures
are rendered from those measurements with Matplotlib (PSF-based license).
Matplotlib is installed as a dependency and is distributed separately.
